# Swarm live Redis (Path 2, no-admin) — 2026-09-03 created, 2026-09-04 reassessed
# Production 3.0.504:6379 is the ONLY local Redis (service, admin-owned). Path 2 :6380 was 8.10.1 but died on reboot.
# 2026-09-04: 8.10.1 dump.rdb v15 incompatible with 3.0.504 ("Can't handle RDB format version 15"), removed.
# Attempted Memurai Developer 4.1.2 install failed with 1603 (requires admin). No Docker/WSL available.
# CURRENT: :6380 unavailable without admin. Local Swarm runs DEGRADED on 3.0.504:6379 (no XADD/XLEN/XREAD streams).
# CI uses redis:7-alpine on 6379 — full streams validated in CI. Local streams tests will skip/fail until 7+ installed.
# To enable full streams locally (requires admin once): winget install Memurai.MemuraiDeveloper OR Docker redis:7-alpine on 6380.
REDIS_URL=redis://127.0.0.1:6379/0
# Intended Path 2 when available: redis-server 7+ --port 6380 --dir .opencode/swarm/data-redis6380 --dbfilename dump.rdb --save "3600 1 300 100 60 10000" --appendonly no
# Persistence: RDB snapshots only (dump.rdb, gitignored). AOF NOT enabled.
# Streams: XADD/XLEN/XREAD validated in CI (redis:7-alpine). Locally DEGRADED on 3.0.504 until 7+ installed.
# Model: SWARM_MODEL_CLIENT stays mock unless separately authorized.
